# Backend / CRM restarts

Agents may restart when rebuild needed. Required: user Cursor terminal — `dssh backend restart; dssh logs backend` or `dssh crm restart; dssh logs crm`. Never silent docker kill/rm of `portfolio-api`/`portfolio-crm`. Full: `docs/agent/dssh-backend-ownership.md`. SIGTERM deep notes: `@.cursor/rules/dssh-backend-sigterm.mdc`.
